---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Axiom Project Protocol | Josh James">
        <div class="border-b border-[#334155] pb-4 mb-6">
            <h1>/sys/portfolio/axiom</h1>
            <p class="text-xs text-[#64748b] font-mono mt-1">CORE THESIS: LONG-HORIZON SOCIAL PROTOCOLS & POST-SCARCITY ARCHITECTURE</p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-6 font-sans text-sm text-[#cbd5e1] leading-relaxed max-w-3xl">
            <div class="bg-[#1e293b] p-4 rounded border border-[#334155] font-mono text-xs mb-4">
                <span class="text-[#34d399]">// SYSTEM STATUS: SYSTEMATIC RESEARCH & DEVELOPMENT (ACTIVE)</span>
            </div>

            <p>
                Axiom is a long horizon personal vision of the marrying of technology, humanity, community for a true post scarcity social protocol - a decade spanning project in the working that aligns with my personal views of what technology should be used for.
            </p>
            
            <p>
                The complete architectural frameworks, structural designs, core processes, and cryptographic protocol implementations are maintained securely outside this portfolio interface.
            </p>

            <div class="pt-4 font-mono text-xs">
                <a 
                    href="https://axiomstandard.space" 
                    target="_blank" 
                    rel="noopener noreferrer" 
                    class="inline-block bg-[#131d31] hover:bg-[#1e293b] text-[#38bdf8] border border-[#334155] hover:border-[#38bdf8] px-4 py-2 rounded transition-colors"
                >
                    → Access Protocol & Complete Architecture via axiomstandard.site
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
</Layout>